  "releaseNotes": "* Added FileExistPolicy to control how existing destination files are handled.\n            * Added DownloadFileExtension to use a temporary extension during download, making in-progress files easy to identify (renamed to the final name on completion).\n            * Fixed an issue where the default Accept-Encoding header could cause corrupted downloads in range/multi-chunk mode (#206).\n            * Fixed completion/error handling: OnComplete could fire multiple times and the original exception was not always propagated to the caller.\n            * Fix Download from Redirected Url #31",
